      "message": "This check has to be done after disable interrupts, so the detect servo interrupt doesn\u0027t keep firing.\nThis is also unnecessary. servo_detectable already checks uart_bitbang_is_enabled. We also want to make sure the servo state is set to undetectable so that we don\u0027t disable uart bitbang because we think servo is on.",
      "range": {
